---
import { Lock } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<!-- Footnote of the hero metadata panel (CaseStudy.astro): the note is
     information about the case's images, like the rest of that panel. -->
<aside class="cs-confidentiality" aria-label="Nota de confidencialidad">
	<p class="cs-confidentiality__label"><Lock class="cs-confidentiality__icon" aria-hidden="true" />Nota de confidencialidad</p>
	<p class="cs-confidentiality__text">
		Algunas imágenes de este caso de estudio han sido modificadas o recreadas para proteger información confidencial. Se incluyen como apoyo visual para explicar el proceso y las decisiones de diseño.
	</p>
</aside>

<style>
	/* Same inner padding as .cs-meta-row; the last row's own hairline
	   separates it, and the italic text marks it as a footnote. */
	.cs-confidentiality {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: calc(8px * var(--ui-scale));
		padding: calc(24px * var(--ui-scale));
	}
	/* Same type as .cs-meta-row__label. */
	.cs-confidentiality__label {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: calc(12px * var(--ui-scale));
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.75;
		letter-spacing: calc(6px * var(--ui-scale));
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 80%, transparent);
	}
	.cs-confidentiality__icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: calc(16px * var(--ui-scale));
		height: calc(16px * var(--ui-scale));
		color: var(--color-action-ghost-text);
	}
	.cs-confidentiality__text {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: max(13px, calc(15px * var(--ui-scale)));
		font-style: italic;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
	}
	@media (max-width: 839px) {
		.cs-confidentiality__label {
			font-size: calc(10px * var(--ui-scale));
		}
	}
</style>
